The problem is this:

> -L /Applications/Grass/grass60.app/Contents/ 
> Resources/grass-6.0.0/lib /usr/local/grass5/lib


No whitespace after -L. Needs to look something like this:

-L/Applications/Grass/grass60.app/Contents/Resources/grass-6.0.0/lib
-L/usr/local/grass5/lib

as "-L../lib" just before.



Hamish


